advanceEpoch.tree
├── given reentrancy attempt
│   └── it should revert with reentrancy guard
└── given no reentrancy
    ├── when limit is zero
    │   └── it should revert with NotValid
    ├── when lastProcessedEpoch equals currentEpoch
    │   └── it should revert with NotValid
    └── when limit is valid and lastProcessedEpoch is behind
        ├── when goal minus epoch is greater than limit
        │   ├── it should process only limit epochs
        │   ├── it should sync TWL buckets with limit
        │   ├── it should update lastProcessedEpoch to epoch plus limit
        │   └── it should emit AdvanceEpoch event
        └── when goal minus epoch is less than or equal to limit
            ├── it should process all pending epochs to current epoch
            ├── it should sync TWL buckets with actual processed count
            ├── it should update lastProcessedEpoch to currentEpoch
            └── it should emit AdvanceEpoch event
